    comment "en" """
        Source V7190 = Swedish 5-char extension of ICD-10 V71.9 SNOMED CT 214171003 36198007, with 5th
        char. Activity suffix has no SNOMED CT analogue. Athena V71.9 crosswalk (concept 45756001) Maps to
        4061564 (Motor vehicle on road in collision with pedal cycle, 214171003, std=S) and 444074
        (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, 36198007, std=S). Both broader; the
        unspecified-occupant qualifier and activity suffix are subsumed. specific / generic.
        """
}
